cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "archimedean_theta: polynomial-time computation of Poincaré theta series of classical Schottky groups"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/mmasdeu/archimedean_theta"
authors:
  - family-names: Masdeu
    given-names: Marc
    affiliation: "Universitat Autònoma de Barcelona and Centre de Recerca Matemàtica"
    email: marc.masdeu@uab.cat
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8763-5599"
abstract: >-
  Sage code accompanying the article "A polynomial-time algorithm to compute theta functions of Schottky groups":
  Abelian integrals, holomorphic differentials, period matrices and the Schottky-Klein prime function of
  classical Schottky groups to hundreds of digits, with the scripts behind the examples and benchmarks of the paper.
keywords:
  - Schottky groups
  - Poincaré theta series
  - Riemann surfaces
  - period matrices
  - Schottky-Klein prime function
